<section class="home-faq" aria-labelledby="faq-title">
  <h2 id="faq-title">A few things to know.</h2>
  <details><summary>Is Lexi free?</summary><p>Yes. Crosswords, spaced repetition, word cards, and your word sky are free, with no ads. Optional Premium adds contrastive learning drills and more companion designs. <a href="/premium/">See Premium details.</a></p></details>
  <details><summary>Who is it for?</summary><p>English-speaking readers, writers, word-game fans, and advanced English learners who want more precise words at their fingertips. Lexi is available on iPhone and iPad.</p></details>
  <details><summary>Is this a daily crossword?</summary><p>Your crosswords are generated from your vocabulary and review schedule. You can play whenever you like; you aren’t limited to one shared puzzle per day.</p></details>
</section>

